   "stem_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead></thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Number of guests, <span data-math=\"g\">g</span></th>\n    <td>1 </td>\n    <td>2 </td>\n    <td>3 </td>\n    <td>12 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Number of cupcakes per guest, <span data-math=\"n\">n</span></th>\n    <td>24 </td>\n    <td>12 </td>\n    <td>8 </td>\n    <td>2 </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n <br> <p>What is one way to write the relationship between the number of guests and the number of cupcakes per guest from the table above?</p>",
